-- HTB deliberate change: upstream alignment (package 4 of the 2026-10-19 profile review).
--
-- Approved by Steven on 2026-10-19 (items A8, B12, B17, C8, C13, C14, C15, C18 and the MeGusta, PSA, iVy unban).
--   - B17 and C15: upstream's ban structure. Banned Groups is upstream's list without NoGroup; MeGusta,
--     PSA and iVy are unbanned everywhere (they become untiered fallbacks, and their WEBRips stay banned by
--     the WEBRip rule). RARBG is banned through Banned Groups (Regular) and (Efficient), TvR through
--     Banned Language Groups (op 9). 2160p Efficient now scores Banned Groups, and Banned Groups
--     (Efficient) keeps only RARBG, as upstream.
--   - B12: Releases with no release group are no longer banned (they were, through a hidden "." condition in
--     Banned Groups). They become untiered fallbacks everywhere, Steven's choice on 2026-10-20 (option A).
--   - C8: 39 pattern updates from Dictionarry (fb09c84) where HTB still had the old upstream pattern.
--     HTB's Repack1 pattern is kept (B11).
--   - HDR: upstream's structure, which the new HDR pattern needs. One HDR format covers HDR10, HLG and PQ;
--     HDR10+ stays at 1,000 (B5), so every HDR flavor still scores the same, and HTB's separate HDR10, HLG
--     and PQ formats retire. It fixes two HTB faults: releases tagged both HLG and HDR got no HDR credit,
--     and Dolby Vision with an HDR10+ fallback was banned as "Dolby Vision (Without Fallback)".
--   - C13 and C14: upstream formats HTB lacked, added with upstream's score where it is 0 (IMF) and unscored
--     otherwise (Nordic, Not Only Original, Banned Groups (Compact), Extended Edition, Not Original or
--     English, 2160p iTunes Enhancement, the ProRes tiers and the 1080p Efficient formats). Unscored
--     formats never reach Radarr or Sonarr.
--   - C18: Upscaled and TV Extras fold into upstream's Upscale and Extras, which now cover movies and TV.
--     The unused anime tiers are removed.
--   - A8: 2160p Remux Only scores 4K remux at 500,000 like 2160p Remux (the ladder already decided).

-- C8: upstream pattern updates (do these first, so formats copied below reuse the new patterns).
UPDATE regular_expressions SET pattern = '(?<=\b[12]\d{3}\b).*\b((Blu[-]?ray|BD)?3D|((H(alf)?|F(ull)?).?)?(O(ver)?.?U(nder)?|S(ide)?[\W_]?B(y)?.?S(ide)?))\b' WHERE name = '3D' AND pattern = '(?<=\b[12]\d{3}\b).*\b((bluray|bd)?3d|sbs|half[ .-]ou|half[ .-]sbs)\b';
